IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `Citi Visa Credit Card Discontinuation — Frequently Asked Questions`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. citi-visa-discontinuation-faq: "Citi Visa Credit Card
-- Discontinuation Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)", "Version: June 2026"
-- (Citibank Singapore Limited), Q1-Q7. A notice FAQ that "corresponds to the
-- separate notification we have sent regarding the discontinuation of your Citi
-- Visa Credit Card". It is the only held primary text about the withdrawal of
-- the Citi Rewards Visa Signature (and, if it applies, the PremierMiles Visa).
--
-- WHAT THE FAQ SAYS THAT BEARS ON EARN.
--   Q3  ThankYou Points on the Visa "transferred from your Citi Visa Credit Card
--       to your Citi Mastercard Credit Card will have the same Points Validity
--       Period as the Citi ThankYou Points available on your Citi Mastercard".
--   Q4  "What will happen to transactions posted to my Citi Visa Credit Card after
--       my Citi Visa Credit Card is discontinued? The transactions will be posted
--       to your Visa Credit Card statement. You will only earn Citi ThankYou
--       Points/Citi Miles/cash back for transactions posted before Visa is
--       discontinued."
--   Q5  A refund after discontinuation is posted to the Visa statement.
--   Q1, Q2, Q6, Q7: replacement card, pro-rated annual fee refund, credit limit,
--       Credit Insure. None bears on what a purchase earns.
-- THE FAQ STATES NO DATE. The discontinuation date is the subject of the open
-- reading F-citi-visa-date: MileLion (12 July 2026, a blog) reports the Citi
-- Rewards Visa is discontinued on 15 October 2026 with 14 October 2026 the last
-- day of use. The module carries that date as a named constant, marked
-- Unconfirmed, and states the earn rule from Q4 independently of it.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Q4 -- the rule`

-- Reported, not stated by Citi: the date after which a Citi Visa stops earning.
GIVETH A DATE
`the reported Citi Visa discontinuation date` MEANS Date 15 10 2026

-- Q4: a Visa transaction earns iff it is posted before the Visa is discontinued.
GIVEN postedOn IS A DATE
      discontinuedOn IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a Citi Visa transaction posted on` postedOn `earns if the Visa is discontinued on` discontinuedOn MEANS
    postedOn LESS THAN discontinuedOn

GIVEN c IS A Card
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the card is a Citi Visa` c MEANS
    c EQUALS `Citi Rewards Visa Signature` OR c EQUALS `Citi PremierMiles Visa`

-- On the reported date, does this purchase, on this card, earn at all? A
-- Mastercard is not affected.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      postedOn IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a purchase on` c `posted on` postedOn `earns on the reported date` MEANS
    IF `the card is a Citi Visa` c
    THEN `a Citi Visa transaction posted on` postedOn `earns if the Visa is discontinued on` (`the reported Citi Visa discontinuation date`)
    ELSE TRUE

-- Whether the reported date matters to this purchase: it does iff the card is a
-- Visa and the purchase posted on or after the reported date.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      postedOn IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the reported date decides whether` c `posted on` postedOn `earns` MEANS
    `the card is a Citi Visa` c AND postedOn AT LEAST (`the reported Citi Visa discontinuation date`)


§§ `Illustrations`

#ASSERT `a Citi Visa transaction posted on` (Date 14 10 2026) `earns if the Visa is discontinued on` (Date 15 10 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`a Citi Visa transaction posted on` (Date 15 10 2026) `earns if the Visa is discontinued on` (Date 15 10 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`a Citi Visa transaction posted on` (Date 20 10 2026) `earns if the Visa is discontinued on` (Date 15 10 2026))
-- ... the same transaction earns if the Visa is in fact discontinued later.
#ASSERT `a Citi Visa transaction posted on` (Date 20 10 2026) `earns if the Visa is discontinued on` (Date 1 11 2026)
-- A Mastercard is not affected.
#ASSERT `a purchase on` `Citi Rewards World Mastercard` `posted on` (Date 20 10 2026) `earns on the reported date`
#ASSERT NOT (`a purchase on` `Citi Rewards Visa Signature` `posted on` (Date 20 10 2026) `earns on the reported date`)
#ASSERT `a purchase on` `Citi Rewards Visa Signature` `posted on` (Date 14 10 2026) `earns on the reported date`
-- The reported date decides only for a Visa posted on or after it.
#ASSERT `the reported date decides whether` `Citi Rewards Visa Signature` `posted on` (Date 20 10 2026) `earns`
#ASSERT NOT (`the reported date decides whether` `Citi Rewards Visa Signature` `posted on` (Date 14 10 2026) `earns`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the reported date decides whether` `Citi Rewards World Mastercard` `posted on` (Date 20 10 2026) `earns`)
